msgctxt "bark 056F:00AB"
msgid "Who are you? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "It is my business, not yours. "
msgstr ""

#. , after ""
msgctxt "bark 056F:01E9"
msgid "I don't care what your name is. I want to know who you are that you feel free to enter into the Sorcerer's Enclave without -my- permission. "
msgstr ""

#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Why do I need -your- permission? "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Some call me the Avatar. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Some call me the Avatar. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Some call me the Avatar. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0343"
msgid "Avatar? Strange title. Now, what I want to know is why you feel free to enter into the Sorcerer's Enclave without -my- permission. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "It is of little import. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "It is of little import. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "It is of little import. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0460"
msgid "That's as it may be, but I will know who you are if you wish to remain here. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "It is my business, not yours. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0536"
msgid "Is that so? You try my patience, and I have no patience. Begone fool! "
msgstr ""

#. , after "What do you want from me? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "What do you want from me? "
msgstr ""

#. , after "What do you want from me? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:05B3"
msgid "What I want is an intelligent response, intruder. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I merely seek knowledge. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I merely seek knowledge. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I merely seek knowledge. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0666"
msgid "We don't give it away at the Enclave. It is earned. Tell me why you are here. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Why do I need -your- permission? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:070C"
msgid "Because I run this place... for all intents and purposes. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I go where I will. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I go where I will. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I go where I will. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:07D8"
msgid "Ah some Fire in you after all! But in truth, while you are here, you go only where I say. Understood? "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I go where I will. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0828"
msgid "Good. I'm glad we see eye to eye. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I go where I will. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0893"
msgid "I did not misspeak myself. You go where I allow you or you die. It's that simple. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I am a great hero! "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I am a great hero! "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I am a great hero! "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0923"
msgid "Maybe where you come from, but here you're nothing unless I say you're something. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I am a great hero! "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "This from one who is nothing. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "No really, I am a great hero. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "No really, I am a great hero. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "No really, I am a great hero. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:09E6"
msgid "Yes, yes, yes. I'm sure you are, child. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "This from one who is nothing. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0A8B"
msgid "I have no qualms about killing you, fool. In fact, I might gain pleasure from the exercise. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "This from one who is nothing. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Aye, exercise would do you good. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Ah, I see. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Ah, I see. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Ah, I see. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0B35"
msgid "Good. I'm glad that you do. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Aye, exercise would do you good. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0BE3"
msgid "What do you mean by that, knave? I could burn you to ashes, if I had a mind to. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Aye, exercise would do you good. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "If only you had a mind. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "You take pleasure in pain? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "You take pleasure in pain? "
msgstr ""

#. , after "You take pleasure in pain? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0D13"
msgid "Only that of my enemies. I was merely saying that you should have a care for your own welfare. Insulting your betters can be hazardous to your health. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "You take pleasure in pain? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "You think you are my better? "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I didn't know you cared. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I didn't know you cared. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I didn't know you cared. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0DAC"
msgid "I don't. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "You think you are my better? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0E4D"
msgid "It is a true fact. You are a stranger, whereas I lead these people... for the most part. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0EF9"
msgid "Are you insinuating that my physique is less than ideal? I could break you like a dry twig. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Your physique is ideal... for a cow. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "What physique? I see no physique. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "What physique? I see no physique. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "What physique? I see no physique. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1006"
msgid "You play the fool to make jest at my expense, but be wary. I will not take more of your insolence. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "What physique? I see no physique. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "But I've just begun to be insolent. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Your physique is ideal... for a cow. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:110F"
msgid "I don't know what this -cow- you speak of is, but I mislike your tone. Run along, boy. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "If only you had a mind. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:11A9"
msgid "I am a forgiving man, but you go too far. I will not take more of your isolence. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:129C"
msgid "Honesty can be as deadly as deceit if it is not tempered by wisdom. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgstr ""

#. , after "But I've just begun to be insolent. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:13A5"
msgid "Your skull will make a fine flagon when I'm done with you. Prepare to meet the Lord of Flame, infidel! "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Deceit... a thing you know well? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Deceit... a thing you know well? "
msgstr ""

#. , after "Deceit... a thing you know well? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:146F"
msgid "Know one thing, infidel, I never -- ever break my word. Why should I defend myself before one such as you? Leave me be. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1513"
msgid "Your tenure on Pagan has ended, dolt! I remand you into the care of the Lord of Flame. "
msgstr ""

#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
